{
  "name": "automation-labs",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "QA Demo System — Phase 10 Automation Learning Labs (Selenium WebDriver; JMeter plans run through a real fail-gate wrapper, see jmeter/scripts/run-jmeter.js); Part 2 AI Systems Testing lab (deterministic mock-first, see ai-systems/README.md); Part 2 Chaos/Reliability lab (deterministic fault injection, see chaos-reliability/README.md); Part 2 Privacy Testing lab (see privacy-testing/README.md); Part 2 Property-Based & Fuzz Testing lab (see property-and-fuzz-testing/README.md); Part 2 Service Virtualization & Contract Testing lab (see service-virtualization/README.md); Part 2 Mutation Testing lab (see mutation-testing/README.md); Part 2 Testcontainers lab (see testcontainers-lab/README.md); Part 2 Data Engineering lab (see data-engineering/README.md); Part 2 Distributed Messaging lab (see distributed-messaging/README.md); Part 2 Supply Chain Security lab (see supply-chain-security/README.md); Part 2 Compatibility Testing lab (see compatibility-testing/README.md); Part 2 i18n Testing lab (see i18n-testing/README.md); Part 2 Modern Protocols lab (see modern-protocols/README.md); Part 2 Production Verification lab (see production-verification/README.md); Part 2 Release Engineering lab (see release-engineering/README.md); Part 3 Database Migration & Schema Evolution lab (see db-migration-testing/README.md); Part 3 Multi-Tenancy Isolation lab (see multi-tenancy-isolation/README.md); Part 3 API Idempotency-Key Replay-Safety lab (see idempotency-testing/README.md); Part 3 Rate Limiting & Abuse Testing lab (see rate-limiting/README.md)",
